    <bpmn:process id="W_W4481" name="W4481. GS1 Membership, GTIN/Barcode Standard &amp; Item-Identification Policy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New SKU onboarding (VS-01.1); GS1 standard update; audit finding
Frequency: Per onboarding + annual policy review
Volume: 35,000 active SKUs + ~5–8% annual new SKUs (~1,500–2,500/yr, the corpus canon)
Owner: Master Data / Auto-ID Lead (VS-29 linkage)
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), IT (VS-27), Quality (VS-31), Private Label (VS-41)
Source: workflow W4481 — GS1 Membership, GTIN/Barcode Standard &amp; Item-Identification Policy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4481_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4481_Lane1" name="Auto-ID Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4481_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4481_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4481_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4481_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4481_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4481_Start3" name="New SKU onboarding (VS-01.1); GS1 standard update; audit finding">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4481_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4481_Task4" name="Auto-ID Lead maintains BuildRight&#x27;s GS1 Philippines membership, Global Company…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Auto-ID Lead maintains BuildRight&#x27;s GS1 Philippines membership, Global Company Prefix (GPC), and the GTIN-assignment rule (GTIN-13/EAN for trade items, GTIN-14 for cases/pallets, GS1-128 for logistics)
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4481_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4481_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4481_Task5" name="Auto-ID Lead assigns/validates GTIN per new SKU, governs reuse (never reuse a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Auto-ID Lead assigns/validates GTIN per new SKU, governs reuse (never reuse a retired GTIN) and bundle/kit GTINs (links to VS-92), and publishes to the item master (VS-29)
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / Master Data
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: Per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4481_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4481_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4481_Task6" name="Auto-ID Lead documents the item-identification policy, trains…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Auto-ID Lead documents the item-identification policy, trains merchandising/private-label (VS-41), and audits adherence via exception reports (VS-29/W1345)
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / IT
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4481_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4481_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4481_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4481_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-683 (ensure controlled execution — Auto-ID Standards, GS1 Governance &amp; Label/Tag Specification (PA-151.1).) | - CTL-683: GTIN uniquely assigned &amp; never reused (VS-29); GS1-standard adherence audited; private-label items gated (VS-41)
Owner: Master Data / Auto-ID Lead (VS-29 linkage)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4481_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4481_Annotation8" targetRef="W4481_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4481_Flow10" sourceRef="W4481_Start3" targetRef="W4481_Task4" />
