    <bpmn:process id="W_W4483" name="W4483. Label &amp; Price-Tag Format Specification and Artwork Standards" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New label need; artwork refresh; RA 7394/DTI change
Frequency: Per need + annual review
Volume: Label format set across hang-tag, shelf-edge, adhesive, bulk-yard, variable
Owner: Auto-ID Lead / Merchandising (VS-01.2)
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Private Label (VS-41), PIM (VS-137), Stores (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4483 — Label &amp; Price-Tag Format Specification and Artwork Standards</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4483_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4483_Lane1" name="Auto-ID Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4483_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4483_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4483_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4483_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4483_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4483_Start3" name="New label need; artwork refresh; RA 7394/DTI change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4483_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4483_Task4" name="Auto-ID Lead/Merchandising specify the label format set (hang-tag, shelf-edge…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Auto-ID Lead/Merchandising specify the label format set (hang-tag, shelf-edge label, adhesive price sticker, bulk-yard tag, variable/catch-weight label) per item type/channel, with required content fields (description, price, unit, barcode, promo, mandatory-discount notice VS-85)
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager / VP Merch
Duration: Annual + per need</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4483_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4483_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4483_Task5" name="Auto-ID Lead/Marketing set artwork/brand standards (logo, color, font…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Auto-ID Lead/Marketing set artwork/brand standards (logo, color, font legibility, bilingual EN/Filipino, DG/SDS pictograms VS-114, DTI-BPS PS/ICC mark VS-117) and the template library in PIM (VS-137)
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / Marketing
Accountable (A): VP Merch
Duration: Annual + per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4483_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4483_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4483_Task6" name="Auto-ID Lead/PIM govern template version control, publish to stores/DC, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Auto-ID Lead/PIM govern template version control, publish to stores/DC, and audit format conformance (W4486)
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / PIM
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4483_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4483_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4483_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4483_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-683 (ensure controlled execution — Auto-ID Standards, GS1 Governance &amp; Label/Tag Specification (PA-151.1).) | - CTL-683: label carries mandatory fields (price/unit/barcode, RA 7394; PS/ICC VS-117; DG pictogram VS-114); template version-controlled; conformance audited (W4486)
Owner: Auto-ID Lead / Merchandising (VS-01.2)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
