    <bpmn:process id="W_W4484" name="W4484. EAS/RFID Tag Selection &amp; SKU-Tagging Policy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Loss/Shrink review (VS-23); RFID program; new high-value category
Frequency: Annual + on category change
Volume: EAS/RFID tagging policy across the 35K-SKU assortment
Owner: Auto-ID Lead / Loss Prevention (VS-23)
Participants: LP (VS-23), Merchandising (VS-01), IT (VS-27), Stores (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4484 — EAS/RFID Tag Selection &amp; SKU-Tagging Policy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4484_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4484_Lane1" name="Auto-ID Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4484_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4484_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4484_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4484_Lane2" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4484_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4484_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4484_Start4" name="Loss/Shrink review (VS-23); RFID program; new high-value category">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4484_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4484_Task5" name="Auto-ID Lead/LP set which SKUs carry EAS (hard tag, soft label, benefit-denial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Auto-ID Lead/LP set which SKUs carry EAS (hard tag, soft label, benefit-denial ink) by shrink/value tier (top high-value: power tools, appliances, PPE, small electronics) aligned to VS-23 shrink targets
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / LP
Accountable (A): LP Director / VP Merch
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4484_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4484_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4484_Task6" name="Auto-ID Lead/LP set the RFID-tagging policy (RFID-enabled categories for…">
