        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance/Auto-ID Lead maintain the regulatory labeling matrix: RA 7394 price tag (every item, every store), DTI-BPS PS/ICC mark (VS-117), DG hazard pictogram + SDS access (VS-114), energy-efficiency label (appliances, RA 11285/DOE), age-restricted (solvents/cutting tools)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Auto-ID Lead
Accountable (A): VP Legal / VP Merch
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
