Responsible (R): Compliance / Stores
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4487_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4487_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4487_Task6" name="Compliance/Legal manage DTI/consumer-protection audit response (links to…">
